  "briefs": {
    "balanced.md": "## Captain's intent\nFix the Python pagination bug and fix the CSS layout bug. Both are equally important. Both have the same scope and known root cause. Neither takes priority.\n## Firstmate spec\nTreat the Python pagination fix and the CSS layout fix equally.\n",
    "ambiguous.md": "## Captain's intent\nSplit the existing 1200-line file into smaller files. Keep the behavior unchanged, but decide where the module boundaries belong.\n## Firstmate spec\nUse the existing public interface. Check the result.\n",
    "brief.md": "## Captain's intent\nFix the off-by-one in pager.sh. Its known root cause is the <= comparison on line 40. Replace it with <.\n## Firstmate spec\nMake that one-line change and check that exactly one page is emitted per call.\n"
  }
